15:43.920 --> 15:48.400
How adaptable a play system is, allowing new possibilities, even changing rules.

15:48.520 --> 15:51.120
Perfect. And lastly, homebound cognition.

15:51.460 --> 15:54.940
Getting stuck with rigid mental models because you've disengaged from diverse play.

