16:05.780 --> 16:10.480
These simulations are shaped by affordances, influenced by privileged gates.

16:10.760 --> 16:12.040
And refined by feedback.

16:12.040 --> 16:17.240
Right. We've seen how institutions shape it, why shallow gamification falls short,

16:17.360 --> 16:19.640
